====== Leetcode 121. Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock (27th Feb)=======
Algorithm for finding maximum profit (Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock):
Step 1: Initialize a variable buy with the first price in the array.
This represents the minimum price seen so far (best day to buy).
Step 2: Initialize a variable profit to 0.
This will store the maximum profit found so far.
Step 3: Traverse the array starting from index 1.
Step 4: For each price:
•	If the current price is smaller than buy, update buy to this price.
(This means we found a better day to buy.)
Step 5: Otherwise, calculate the profit if we sell today:
current price minus buy.
Step 6: Compare this profit with the existing profit.
If it is greater, update profit.
Step 7: Continue this process until all prices are checked.
Step 8: Return profit.
This will be the maximum profit possible from one buy and one sell.
 Time Complexity = O(n) 
Space Complexity = O(1)


                --------------> Code <----------------
class Solution {
    public int maxProfit(int[] prices) {
        int proft=0;
        int buy=prices[0];
        for(int i=1;i<prices.length;i++){
            if(prices[i]<buy){
                buy=prices[i];
                continue;
            }
            proft=Math.max(proft,prices[i]-buy);
        }
        return proft;
    }
}
